  "method": "## Method\n\nSoften the peppers and onion in the olive oil over a low flame for twenty minutes. They\nshould slump rather than colour. Add the garlic, paprika and cumin and stir for one minute.\n\nAdd the tomatoes and salt, break them down with the back of a spoon, and simmer uncovered\nuntil the sauce holds a channel when you drag a spoon through it — about fifteen minutes.\n\nScatter the parsley and serve straight from the pan.",
